## SQ-LB-01 | netherite lunchbox resolves as an item entity
@group A
@commands boot; console: `summon item 0 100 0 {Item:{id:"solapplepie:netherite_lunchbox",Count:1b},NoGravity:1b}`, then `execute if entity @e[type=item,nbt={Item:{id:"solapplepie:netherite_lunchbox"}}]`
@pass the test prints `Test passed`; boot log has no `InvalidInjectionException` / `Mixin apply failed` naming `AlexsMobsSeagull`; `latest.log` has no `Unknown item 'solapplepie:netherite_lunchbox'`; the id resolves
